{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03879","headline":"北使长城 · 王无竞","name":"北使长城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦世筑长城，长城无极已。\n暴兵四十万，兴工九千里。\n死人如乱麻，白骨相撑委。\n殚弊未云悟，穷毒岂知止。\n胡尘未北灭，楚兵遽东起。\n六国复嚣嚣，两龙鬬觺觺。\n卯金竟握谶，反璧俄沦祀。\n仁义寝邦国，狙暴行终始。\n一旦咸阳宫，翻爲汉朝市。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王无竞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}